# §6: whether `ap-merge.sh` (or anything else) belongs IN the pack. Forcing a legitimately per-repo
# file into the pack can overwrite local adaptation the updater has no merge strategy for; that is an
# owner decision, not this updater's to make. This change only makes the drift visible.
